  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 609.01 F-1C Quarterly Statement of Operations.\n\n(a) Any water utility which does not file a statement of operations with the department and the commission on a monthly basis shall complete and file department \"Form F-1C, Quarterly Statement of Operations\" revised March 2024 with the department and the commission, available on the department’s website at www.energy.nh.gov, on a quarterly basis.\n\nSource. #13911, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 600)",
